## environments/dev.tfvars
```hcl
environment = "dev"
vpc_name    = "dev-vpc"
db_instance_class = "db.t3.micro"
db_multi_az       = false
s3_replication_enabled = false
oidc_provider_arn = "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/DEVCLUSTERID"
oidc_provider_url = "https://oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/DEVCLUSTERID"
# db_password supplied via secrets.dev.tfvars (SOPS-encrypted, never committed)
```

## environments/prod.tfvars
```hcl
environment = "prod"
vpc_name    = "prod-vpc"
db_instance_class = "db.t3.medium"
db_multi_az       = true
s3_replication_enabled = true
s3_replication_rules = [{
  id                     = "replicate-to-dr"
  destination_bucket_arn = "arn:aws:s3:::dr-prod-app-assets"
  storage_class          = "STANDARD"
}]
oidc_provider_arn = "arn:aws:iam::123456789012:oidc-provider/oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/PRODCLUSTERID"
oidc_provider_url = "https://oidc.eks.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/id/PRODCLUSTERID"
```

---

## Usage

```bash
# Secrets via SOPS (never in Git)
sops -d secrets/prod.secrets.tfvars > /tmp/prod.secrets.tfvars

terraform workspace select prod
terraform init -reconfigure \
  -backend-config="key=app/prod/terraform.tfstate"
terraform apply \
  -var-file=environments/prod.tfvars \
  -var-file=/tmp/prod.secrets.tfvars
```

## Acceptance criteria mapping

| Criterion | Where |
|---|---|
| Bucket versioned, encrypted, no public access | S3 module (`versioning`, SSE AES256/KMS, `public_access_block`) |
| RDS deletion protection, 7-day backups, private | RDS module (`deletion_protection = true`, `backup_retention_period = 7`, `publicly_accessible = false`) |
| Secret never in plaintext | SOPS-encrypted tfvars, `sensitive = true` |
| Least privilege IAM, no wildcards | IAM module with explicit S3 actions + OIDC `sub` condition |
| Cross-region replication (prod only) | `replication_enabled` flag + `replication_rules` |
| Env isolation | Separate tfvars + separate backend keys / workspaces |
